Z||000006||Monkeyman||12-17-1999||10:21 PM||||First you gotta click on the "Pennocks Image Poster" icon located on the bottom of the page.  Download the program, then follow the directions.  Real easy.  Make sure (once you're ready to upload an image) that you don't have any spaces in the "title" of your image.  If you do, you might replace the spaces with the underline symbol (_).  The program won't accept images with spaces in their names.<P>BTW-nothing personal against your Mazda (I'm sure it's a nice car), but those are a dime a dozen and it gets tougher every day to find a good Fiero.  Maybe you could find someone to give you a short term loan until you get situated.  You will regret selling the Fiero.<P>William-I know about the one from the East, but didn't know about another.  Congratulations.  Email me and let me know what it is.||||reg||1
